# Trivy - filesystem and IaC scanning.
#
# No containers in this stack, so image and base-layer scanning do not apply. What is
# left is dependency CVEs and infrastructure misconfiguration, and dependencies are
# essentially the whole CVE surface without a base image.
#
# EVERY LINE HERE NEEDS A DATE AND AN OWNER, in this shape:
#
#   # CVE-2024-12345
#   # reason : vulnerable path not reachable - CLI entry point is unused here
#   # owner  : @REPLACE-ME
#   # expires: 2026-01-15
#   # ticket : PROJ-482
#   CVE-2024-12345
#
# An undated line is not an accepted risk; it is an unreviewed one. /waivers reports
# anything here that is missing a field or past its date.
#
# Keep the mirror entry in security/suppressions/ so there is one place to sweep.

# (no active suppressions)
